Its automated suppression systems are trusted worldwide for their ultrafast response, reliability and compliance with international safety standards, backed by decades of research and development, including industry-first qualifications and collaborations with leading institutions. The company''s active explosion barriers have been credited with preventing methane ignition escalation at coal mines including Forzando South and Syferfontein. With a footprint spanning Africa, Australia, China, Europe, the Middle East and the USA, its mission is to prevent disaster before it strikes. It suits mining, industrial and military operators who need certified explosion, fire and dust suppression systems, and the company is based at Zwavelpoort Road.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://www.explospot.com/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'explospot-systems-pty-ltd-zwavelpoort' AND description = 'ExploSpot Systems, founded in 1994 and based in Zwavelpoort, Pretoria, designs and manufactures automatic explosion, fire and dust suppression systems for the mining, industrial and military sectors, and is the only such system approved by the SABS.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
  AND owner_user_id IS NULL AND COALESCE(subscription_tier, 0) = 0 AND COALESCE(origin, '') != 'owner_submitted'
  AND status = 'published' AND closed_at IS NULL AND is_test = 0
  AND custom_blocks IS NULL AND page_html IS NULL
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_claims c WHERE c.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM subscriptions s WHERE s.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_photos p WHERE p.business_id = businesses.id);
