Its work covers prototype development, component procurement, pick-and-place production and full assembly and testing of custom electronic products, built for industries including cash-in-transit, telecommunications, fuel and mining, where equipment must perform reliably in demanding conditions. The company positions its engineers'' experience as the key to delivering high-quality solutions in very short time-frames, even for highly customised designs. It suits businesses in these specialised industries that need a local partner for custom electronics from prototype through to finished product, and the business is on Rooiberg Street in The Willows.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://www.firmlogik.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'firmlogik-the-willows' AND description = 'Firmlogik is an electronics engineering and manufacturing company in The Willows industrial park, offering prototype development, component procurement, pick-and-place production and full assembly and testing of custom electronic products for industries including cash-in-transit, telecommunications, fuel and mining.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
